WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:22.000
[Instrumental Intro]

00:00:22.214 --> 00:00:29.500
Black velvet, a million lights

00:00:29.600 --> 00:00:36.840
Floating silent through the endless night

00:00:36.880 --> 00:00:42.500
The world below, a sleeping blue

00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:48.211
I'm holding my breath, I'm thinking of you

00:00:59.302 --> 00:01:04.500
The signal's given, the turn is made

00:01:04.600 --> 00:01:12.500
The point of no return, the price is paid

00:01:12.600 --> 00:01:18.500
The fragile hull begins to shake

00:01:18.600 --> 00:01:22.500
A promise that we're bound to make

00:01:22.600 --> 00:01:27.097
Here comes the friction, feel the fire

00:01:27.137 --> 00:01:32.480
Burning up with our desire

00:01:32.580 --> 00:01:36.500
A sheet of flame, a crimson glow

00:01:36.600 --> 00:01:40.500
The only way we know to go

00:01:40.600 --> 00:01:45.000
We're coming home, we're breaking through

00:01:45.100 --> 00:01:50.000
This atmosphere... with you

00:02:04.848 --> 00:02:09.770
The pressure builds, the gauges scream

00:02:10.530 --> 00:02:17.500
This is the violence of the dream

00:02:17.600 --> 00:02:22.500
A single tear in the metal skin

00:02:22.600 --> 00:02:27.436
Is all it takes to let the outside in

00:02:37.838 --> 00:02:44.920
Here comes the friction, feel the fire

00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:49.500
Burning up with our desire

00:02:49.600 --> 00:02:53.043
A sheet of flame, a crimson glow

00:02:53.063 --> 00:02:56.800
The only way we know to go

00:02:56.900 --> 00:03:00.500
We're coming home, we're breaking through

00:03:00.600 --> 00:03:03.667
This atmosphere... with you

00:03:04.647 --> 00:03:13.000
We're losing control, the edges blur

00:03:13.100 --> 00:03:21.080
A terror and a beauty...

00:03:22.342 --> 00:03:25.500
Burning up!

00:03:26.000 --> 00:03:58.000
[Guitar Solo]

